  measures:
  - category: 2
    title: Ventilate tunnels and greenhouses
    detail: Keep the air moving and the humidity down, especially at night.
  - category: 5
    title: Grow resistant varieties
    detail: Many varieties carry resistance to leaf mould.
  - category: 0
    title: Clean the house between crops
    detail: Spores survive on debris, stakes and the structure itself.
